<title>有时候很想活得像村上春树小说里的男主，普通但是品味良好，情绪淡淡但是经常被卷入突发事件，又出人意料得很容易进入异性关系。</title>
<link>https://t.me/weekly_books/2625</link>
<guid isPermaLink="true">https://t.me/weekly_books/2625</guid>
<pubDate>Mon, 09 Nov 2026 23:29:00 +0000</pubDate>
<description><![CDATA[<div>有时候很想活得像村上春树小说里的男主，普通但是品味良好，情绪淡淡但是经常被卷入突发事件，又出人意料得很容易进入异性关系。<br/><br/>然后我会遇到美丽的、古怪的、充满奇幻色彩但带着神秘创伤的女主们，像鹅卵石一样打破生活。<br/><br/>比如一位穿着红色风衣的女士在咖啡店拦下我，问我是否相信鸟类拥有前世记忆。接着我们开始约会，雀子会在凌晨四点打电话给我，问我是否在家附近见到一只衔着白头鹎的赤色狐狸。<br/><br/>在荒诞且幽默的剧情之后，她们毫无征兆地消失或是死亡。给我的心留下淡淡的伤痕。我已经不再是那个山田了。<br/><br/>原文 <a href="https://www.threads.com/share/GFfv6fZex" target="_blank" rel="noopener">https://www.threads.com/share/GFfv6fZex</a></div><p><img src="https://telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F9988.png" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://cdn4.telesco.pe/file/AJ4Kk823LidqZkzT5-4jE3TCdHqG_F8PvQV_N5UBQIvyUWvVINpGYYdKVbzaTQKAfGo1Djc0sjVsLpZY7j-M2eDciQ7E89PgtV9SnHB1KMjWHMWUXcqdslOt_MclVyIvGOclhJHl1b2KSFhxi1MhVg0omqz3CAA8IZM-fJVE45QygQcRU97o1mhQSo8WnXfJIX-xuUvyl-2UgUY877vNHd7tuH5x5BR9BsGFnIQVpV7-XXdd5VgEQXtSzjb-SoJ3CRW8shJOaPjaWrJzaV0S2SYkrImyH1Hff5egX-Brcuc0Fc0_vSq6fIJuoQ51MFtHfi0qmolJMRxxwFoOt09AFg.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F918D.png" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F918E.png" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><blockquote style='border-left:3px solid #ccc;padding-left:8px;'><img src="https://cdn4.telesco.pe/file/AJ4Kk823LidqZkzT5-4jE3TCdHqG_F8PvQV_N5UBQIvyUWvVINpGYYdKVbzaTQKAfGo1Djc0sjVsLpZY7j-M2eDciQ7E89PgtV9SnHB1KMjWHMWUXcqdslOt_MclVyIvGOclhJHl1b2KSFhxi1MhVg0omqz3CAA8IZM-fJVE45QygQcRU97o1mhQSo8WnXfJIX-xuUvyl-2UgUY877vNHd7tuH5x5BR9BsGFnIQVpV7-XXdd5VgEQXtSzjb-SoJ3CRW8shJOaPjaWrJzaV0S2SYkrImyH1Hff5egX-Brcuc0Fc0_vSq6fIJuoQ51MFtHfi0qmolJMRxxwFoOt09AFg.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"><br><b><a href="https://threads.com/share/GFfv6fZex">SHIJIEYU (@nosta1gic_) on Threads</a></b><br><small>Threads</small><